 did not disclose this to the buyer, the loss or damage is at the risk of the seller. Article 69 (1) In cases not within articles 67 and 68, the risk passes to the buyer when he takes over the goods or, if he does not do so in due time, from the time when the goods are placed at his disposal he commits a breach of contract by failing to take delivery. CONVENTION ON CONTRACTS FOR THE INTERNATIONAL SALE OF GOODS"